@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor ":Apprenant" as User
participant "FE: Frontend" as FE
participant "authCtrl: AuthController" as AuthCtrl
participant "keycloakAdmin: IKeycloakAdminService" as KCService
participant "userRepo: UserRepository" as Repo
participant "KC: Keycloak API" as KC

== Inscription (Registration) ==
User -> FE: submit(email, password, fullName)
activate FE
FE -> AuthCtrl: POST /auth/register
activate AuthCtrl

AuthCtrl -> KCService: createUser(email, password, fullName)
activate KCService
KCService -> KC: POST /admin/realms/{realm}/users
activate KC
KC --> KCService: 201 Created
deactivate KC
KCService --> AuthCtrl: void
deactivate KCService

AuthCtrl -> Repo: save(new User(email, fullName))
activate Repo
Repo --> AuthCtrl: User
deactivate Repo

AuthCtrl --> FE: 201 Created (Success)
deactivate AuthCtrl
FE --> User: Affiche "Inscription validée"
deactivate FE

== Authentification (Login Direct Access) ==
User -> FE: submit(email, password)
activate FE
FE -> KC: POST /realms/{realm}/protocol/openid-connect/token\n(grant_type=password)
activate KC
KC -> KC: verifyCredentials(LDAP Talan / DB locale)
KC --> FE: 200 OK (access_token, refresh_token)
deactivate KC
FE -> FE: storeTokens(localStorage)
FE --> User: Redirige vers Tableau de bord
deactivate FE
@enduml
